OL,3,GNEWSAThe Doncaster teenager setting his
OL,4,Asights on NFL stardom
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen a teenage American football player
OL,7,Ffrom Doncaster received his first offer
OL,8,Fto play for a university in the US, he
OL,9,Fwas "sceptical" of it being real. Now,
OL,10,FZak Pye has 33 offers and his eyes set
OL,11,Fon a team that would see him play in
OL,12,Ffront of about 20,000 people.
OL,14,FOne more season playing for Sheffield
OL,15,FGiants stands between the 19-year-old
OL,16,Fand his potential move next year to
OL,17,FEastern Kentucky University.
OL,19,FHe says: "I feel like from there you
OL,20,Fcan get spotlighted, whether it's to a
OL,21,Fbetter Division 1 school or to just to
OL,22,Fprogress at Kentucky.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
